    "sub_name": "專題研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS STUDY (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程配合工學院與本學程安排專題演講，讓研究生瞭解相關產業的狀況，同時，並請學生針對論文相關議題進行專題報告與討論，並藉由課堂討論啟發學生對於研究規劃與討論論文相關問題及如何應用於實際研究上。",
    "describe_eh": "This course contains invited speeches and seminar reports. The invited speeches will be arranged by Engineering College and master program office in order to stimulate the students to understand the situation of the related industry. The seminar reports will be prepared by the students. To discuss with students about the content of their thesis or research paper and how to apply it in the actual research work.",
